#: ../../backups/integrations/veeam.rst:52
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once Veeam service has been integrated with |morpheus|, Veeam server(s) "
"will be available to select as the backup provider for VMware, Hyper-V, "
"SCVMM, and vCloud Director cloud integrations "
"(:menuselection:`Infrastructure --> Clouds` > Edit a compatible Cloud). "
"To enable Veeam backups, select the appropriate Veeam server as the "
"\"backup provider\" for your cloud integrations as needed. Failure to do "
"so will result in blank ``Backup Repositories`` and ``Backup Job "
"Templates`` options when configuring Veeam Backups during provisioning."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que el servicio Veeam se ha integrado con |morpheus|, los "
"servidor(es) Veeam estarán disponibles para seleccionar como proveedor de"
" backup para integraciones de nube VMware, Hyper-V y vCloud Director "
"(:menuselection:`Infraestructura --> Nubes` > Editar una Nube "
"compatible). Para habilitar backups de Veeam, seleccione el servidor "
"Veeam apropiado como \"proveedor de backup\" para sus integraciones de "
"nube según sea necesario. No hacerlo resultará en opciones en blanco de "
"``Backup Repositories`` y ``Backup Job Templates`` al configurar Backups "
"de Veeam durante el aprovisionamiento."

#: ../../backups/integrations/veeam.rst:55
msgid "Set Veeam as Cloud Backup Target"
msgstr "Configurar Veeam como destino de Backup de Nube"

#: ../../backups/integrations/veeam.rst:57
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once the initial integration is made, set this integration as the backup "
"provider for as many supported Clouds as needed. Veeam integrations are "
"supported as backup targets for VMware, Hyper-V, SCVMM, and vCloud "
"Director Clouds."
msgstr ""
"Una vez realizada la integración inicial, configure esta integración como"
" proveedor de backup para tantas Nubes compatibles como sea necesario. "
"Las integraciones de Veeam son compatibles como destino de backup para "
"Nubes VMware, Hyper-V y vCloud Director en este momento."

